role":"plan","bead_id":"sase-1ox.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-1ox[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Capacity inspector redesign — answer \"can new work start, and who [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]is using it?\" at a glance[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Opening the capacity inspector (`,l`) answers three questions in [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]under a second: can a new agent start right now, who is using the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]capacity, and who is waiting for it and why. A slot gauge, a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]plain-English verdict, tiered sections, and a detail strip replace [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the flat wall of dim text. The noise of inactive records is folded [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]away. Every number still comes straight from the authoritative [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]report, so nothing is estimated and nothing unknown ever reads as [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]free.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]capacity_inspector_redesign.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/capacity_inspector_redesign.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-1ox[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-1ox/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Phase view-model: tiered capacity view, verdict, and gauge [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]geometry[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]view-model[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]view-model: additively extend the shared stdlib-only capacity view with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a verdict, limit provenance, tiered sections, queue tones, durations, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and gauge cell geometry. Existing renderers keep their output.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Phase inspector: redesigned TUI capacity inspector[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]inspector[dim] · [dim][/dim]after view-model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]inspector: rebuild the modal around the gauge, verdict, tiered sections,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and detail strip, with stable selection, h/l folding, a freshness [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ticker, and a verdict-first chip tooltip. Update goldens and TUI docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Phase cli: `sase agent load` parity and legacy view cleanup[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after inspector[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: move `sase agent load` onto the tiered view per the cli_parity [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]decision, delete legacy view fields with no remaining consumer, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]update the runner-slots docs.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-1ox","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-1ox.1","reasoning_effort":"high","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-1ox.1"},"source_run_id":"run-b568472e18b0f575a8f8c486bb2aba4e","started_at":"2026-10-27T14:51:12.955682+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"38c07f2208e137d987e955c19497a6c3287c9607155c6faa1b78f00967edc4d1","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1ox.1--2/chat.md","size_byte